    "123456" : {

    },
    "A 2-year green card is CONDITIONAL residence — you remove the conditions rather than renewing the card. Do NOT file Form I-90 for this." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una green card de 2 años es residencia CONDICIONAL: se eliminan las condiciones en vez de renovar la tarjeta. NO presentes el Formulario I-90 para esto."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2 年期绿卡属于「有条件居留」，你需要解除条件，而不是续期。请勿为此提交 I-90 表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A buyer's agent represents you, not the seller. You may be asked to sign a buyer agreement — read what it says about services and fees before signing." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un agente del comprador te representa a ti, no al vendedor. Puede que te pidan firmar un acuerdo de comprador: lee qué dice sobre servicios y honorarios antes de firmar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "买方经纪人代表你，而不是卖家。你可能被要求签买方协议，签字前读清楚服务内容和费用条款。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A callback" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una devolución de llamada"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "回电时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few quick questions so Tadah can tailor the checklist." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unas preguntas rápidas para que Tadah ajuste la lista."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "回答几个小问题，Tadah 就能为你定制清单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A first plan can be one page — you can refine it later." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un primer plan puede ser de una página; puedes pulirlo después."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第一版计划一页纸就行，以后可以再完善。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A free USCIS online account lets you file, pay, upload documents, and track your case." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una cuenta en línea gratuita de USCIS te permite presentar, pagar, subir documentos y seguir tu caso."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "免费的 USCIS 在线账户可用于提交、缴费、上传文件和跟踪案件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A government photo ID." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una identificación con foto emitida por el gobierno."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一份政府签发的带照片的身份证件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A health permit if you handle food." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un permiso sanitario si manejas alimentos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你经营食品，需要卫生许可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
