          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple 未返回登录令牌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply at HealthCare.gov — it routes you to your state's Marketplace if it runs one. Open enrollment is usually Nov 1–Jan 15." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solicítalo en HealthCare.gov: te dirige al Marketplace de tu estado si tiene uno. La inscripción abierta suele ser del 1 de nov. al 15 de ene."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 HealthCare.gov 申请。如果你所在州有自己的市场，它会把你转过去。公开参保期通常为 11 月 1 日至次年 1 月 15 日。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply at HealthCare.gov and report the life change, or start a new application." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solicita en HealthCare.gov e informa el cambio de vida, o inicia una nueva solicitud."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 HealthCare.gov 上申请并报告这次人生变化，或开始一份新的申请。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply for a state sales-tax permit so you can collect and send in sales tax." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solicita un permiso estatal de impuesto sobre las ventas para poder cobrarlo y remitirlo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "申请州销售税许可证，以便你收取并上缴销售税。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply for an SSN online, then bring your documents to a Social Security office — it's free." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solicita el SSN en línea y luego lleva tus documentos a una oficina del Seguro Social: es gratis."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先在线申请 SSN，再把证件带到社会安全局办公室，免费。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply for citizenship" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solicitar la ciudadanía"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "申请入籍"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applying is free — never pay for the number itself." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solicitarlo es gratis: nunca pagues por el número en sí."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "申请是免费的，绝不要为号码本身付费。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appointment guide" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Guía de citas"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "预约指南"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arrange the move — truck, container, or movers — and get boxes." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Organiza la mudanza —camión, contenedor o empresa de mudanzas— y consigue cajas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安排搬家方式：租货车、租集装箱或请搬家公司，并准备好纸箱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arrange your laptop/equipment and remote access (VPN, accounts)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Organiza tu computadora o equipo y el acceso remoto (VPN, cuentas)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "准备好笔记本电脑等设备和远程访问权限（VPN、各类账户）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arrange your laptop/equipment shipment and remote access (VPN, accounts)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Coordina el envío de tu laptop/equipo y el acceso remoto (VPN, cuentas)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安排你的笔记本电脑/设备寄送以及远程访问（VPN、账户）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arrive about 15 minutes early for any new-patient paperwork." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Llega unos 15 minutos antes para el papeleo de paciente nuevo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提前约 15 分钟到达，以便填写新患者表格。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As a 1099 contractor, no taxes are taken out of your pay — you handle them yourself. Set aside roughly 25–30% of each payment, and expect to pay the IRS four times a year." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Como contratista 1099, no se retienen impuestos de tu pago: los manejas tú. Aparta aproximadamente el 25–30% de cada pago y espera pagarle al IRS cuatro veces al año."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作为 1099 合同工，你的报酬不会预扣任何税，要自己处理。每笔收入大约留出 25–30%，并预计每年要向 IRS 缴税四次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As a 1099 contractor, no taxes are taken out of your pay — you handle them yourself. Set money aside from each payment, and check whether you need to make estimated tax payments during the year." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Como contratista 1099 no te retienen impuestos: los gestionas tú. Aparta dinero de cada pago y comprueba si debes hacer pagos de impuestos estimados durante el año."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作为 1099 承包人，收入不预扣税款，需自行处理。请从每笔款项中留出税金，并确认年内是否需要预缴税款。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As a sole proprietor there's usually no state formation filing — but file a DBA (\"doing business as\") if required by your state or local government to use a business name." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Como empresario individual, por lo general no hay que presentar una constitución ante el estado, pero registra un DBA (\"doing business as\", nombre comercial) si tu estado o gobierno local lo exige para usar un nombre de negocio."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作为个体经营者，通常无需向州注册成立公司，但如果你所在的州或地方政府要求使用商号，则需申报 DBA（\"doing business as\"，即以某商号经营）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As a sole proprietor there's usually no state formation filing — but file a DBA (\"doing business as\") if you'll use a business name." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Como empresario individual normalmente no hay que registrar la constitución ante el estado, pero presenta un DBA (\"nombre comercial\") si usarás un nombre de negocio."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作为个体经营者，通常无需向州提交成立文件，但如果使用公司名经营，要登记 DBA（“以…名义经营”）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As a sole proprietor there's usually no state formation filing. If you'll trade under a name that isn't your own legal name, file a DBA (\"doing business as\") if your state or local government requires one." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Como propietario único normalmente no hay trámite estatal de constitución. Si vas a operar con un nombre distinto al tuyo legal, presenta un DBA (\"doing business as\") si tu estado o gobierno local lo exige."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作为个体经营者通常无需州级设立登记。若你将使用与本人法定姓名不同的名称经营，且所在州或地方政府有要求，请办理 DBA（“以…名义经营”）登记。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ASK" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PREGUNTAR"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "询问"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask %@ about this document." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Preguntar a %@ sobre este documento."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "向 %@ 询问这份文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask about bus transportation, free/reduced meals, and after-school programs." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pregunta por el transporte escolar, las comidas gratis o a precio reducido y los programas extraescolares."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "询问校车、免费／减价餐食和课后项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask about one-time fees: deposits, installation, and equipment/router rental." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pregunta sobre cargos únicos: depósitos, instalación y renta de equipo/router."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "询问一次性费用：押金、安装费以及设备/路由器租赁费。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask about one-time fees: installation, equipment/router rental, deposits." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pregunta por cargos únicos: instalación, alquiler de equipo/router, depósitos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "询问一次性费用：安装费、设备／路由器租金、押金。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask about your deductible, a rental car, and the timeline." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pregunta por tu deducible, un coche de alquiler y los plazos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "询问你的自付额、租车以及处理时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask each lender for a Loan Estimate and compare the APR and fees, not just the rate." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pide a cada prestamista un Loan Estimate y compara la APR y las comisiones, no solo la tasa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "向每家贷款机构索取贷款估算单（Loan Estimate），比较年化利率（APR）和费用，而不只是利率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask for separate specialists if anything looks off — roof, sewer line, foundation, pests." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pide especialistas aparte si algo se ve mal: techo, drenaje, cimientos, plagas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "哪里看着不对劲就单独请专项师傅来查：屋顶、下水管道、地基、白蚁虫害。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask for the first available appointment, and the cancellation waitlist." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pide la primera cita disponible y la lista de espera por cancelaciones."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "询问最早可预约的时间，以及取消候补名单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask HR for the benefits guide and your enrollment deadline." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pídele a Recursos Humanos la guía de beneficios y tu fecha límite de inscripción."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "向 HR 索取福利说明和你的参保截止日期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask HR whether you're a W-2 employee or a 1099 contractor — it changes which tax forms you file." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pregunta a RR. HH. si eres empleado W-2 o contratista 1099: cambia qué formularios de impuestos presentas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "向 HR 确认你是 W-2 雇员还是 1099 承包人，这会影响你报哪些税表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask the enrollment office for an interpreter if you need one." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si lo necesitas, pide un intérprete en la oficina de inscripción."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如有需要，向招生办公室申请翻译。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask the lender about any new or higher fees." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pregunta al prestamista por cualquier comisión nueva o más alta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "就任何新增或上涨的费用询问贷款机构。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask what it will cost up front and what to bring." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pregunta de antemano cuánto costará y qué llevar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提前询问费用以及需要带什么。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask what their fee is and who pays it — get it in writing." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pregunta cuál es su honorario y quién lo paga, y pídelo por escrito."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "问清佣金多少、由谁支付，并落实到书面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask what to bring to qualify for sliding-scale fees (often proof of income)." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pregunta qué llevar para acceder a la tarifa según ingresos (a menudo, comprobante de ingresos)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "询问需要带什么才能享受浮动收费（通常是收入证明）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask whether a telehealth (video) visit is an option — it can be faster." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pregunta si es posible una consulta por telemedicina (video): puede ser más rápida."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "询问是否可以远程（视频）就诊，可能更快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask whether the shop can bill the insurer directly." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pregunta si el taller puede facturar directamente a la aseguradora."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "问修理厂能否直接向保险公司结算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask your insurer about roadside/tow coverage and approved shops." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pregunta a tu aseguradora por la cobertura de asistencia/grúa y los talleres aprobados."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "向保险公司询问道路救援/拖车保障和认可的修理厂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask your insurer how your medical costs are handled — it depends on your state and your policy." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pregunta a tu aseguradora cómo se cubren tus gastos médicos: depende de tu estado y de tu póliza."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "询问保险公司你的医疗费用如何处理，这取决于你所在的州和保单内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask your insurer whether your policy covers a rental car." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pregunta a tu aseguradora si tu póliza cubre un coche de alquiler."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "询问保险公司你的保单是否包含租车。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At least %lld characters" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al menos %lld caracteres"
