        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "月底或夏季要早预订，很容易订满。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Book it within a few days — the window in your contract is usually short." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agéndala en pocos días: el plazo de tu contrato suele ser corto."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "几天之内就要约好，合同给的时间通常很短。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Book online as soon as you're eligible; cancellations open earlier slots, so check back." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agenda en línea en cuanto seas elegible; las cancelaciones liberan citas más tempranas, así que vuelve a revisar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一符合条件就上网预约。别人取消时会空出更早的名额，所以要多回来刷一刷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Book the home inspection right away — your contract gives you a short window to inspect and to raise repairs or walk away." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agenda la inspección de la casa de inmediato: tu contrato te da un plazo corto para inspeccionar y para pedir reparaciones o retirarte."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "立刻预约验房。合同给你的验房时间很短，在这段时间内你才能提出维修要求或者退出交易。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Book the road test as soon as you're eligible — appointment slots are often weeks out." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
