            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "带齐材料和费用，实习驾照一般当天就能拿到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bring your insurance card and a photo ID, and arrive early for new-patient forms." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
