        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "购买房屋保险并把保单交给贷款机构。没有保单就无法完成过户。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Buying a home" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comprar una casa"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "买房"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "By law you get the Closing Disclosure at least 3 business days before closing so you can check it. Compare it line by line against the Loan Estimate you were given — ask about anything that moved." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Por ley recibes el Closing Disclosure al menos 3 días hábiles antes del cierre para que puedas revisarlo. Compáralo línea por línea con el Loan Estimate que te dieron y pregunta por cualquier cifra que haya cambiado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "法律规定过户结算说明书要在过户前至少 3 个工作日交到你手上，就是给你核对用的。把它和之前拿到的贷款报价单（Loan Estimate）逐行对照，有变动的地方都要问清楚。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "By law you get the Closing Disclosure at least 3 business days before closing. Compare it line-by-line to your Loan Estimate and question anything that jumped." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Por ley recibes el Closing Disclosure al menos 3 días hábiles antes del cierre. Compáralo línea por línea con tu Loan Estimate y cuestiona lo que haya subido."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按法律规定，过户至少 3 个工作日前你会收到《成交披露》（Closing Disclosure）。逐行与你的贷款估算单比较，对任何上涨的项目提出疑问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Call %lld of %lld this month." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
