          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check whether you need to pay quarterly estimated taxes (federal, and state if it has income tax) — you generally do if you'll owe $1,000 or more." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comprueba si debes pagar impuestos estimados trimestrales (federales, y estatales si hay impuesto sobre la renta): normalmente aplica si vas a deber $1,000 o más."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "确认你是否需要按季度预缴税款（联邦，以及征收所得税的州）。通常在预计欠税 1,000 美元以上时需要。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check whether your state lets you take the written test online or only in person." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
