          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los centros de salud comunitarios ofrecen descuentos según tus ingresos y el tamaño de tu familia: puedes ser atendido sin seguro."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "社区健康中心根据收入和家庭人数提供滑动收费折扣，没有保险也能就诊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare a couple of plans on speed and the total monthly price." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compara un par de planes por velocidad y precio mensual total."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从网速和每月总价比较几个套餐。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare banks/credit unions on fees, minimum balance, and ATMs — look for a no-fee, no-overdraft account." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compara bancos y cooperativas de crédito por comisiones, saldo mínimo y cajeros: busca una cuenta sin comisiones ni sobregiros."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "比较各银行／信用社的费用、最低余额和 ATM：寻找无月费、无透支的账户。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare every fee against your Loan Estimate and ask about anything that grew." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compara cada cargo con tu Loan Estimate y pregunta por todo lo que haya subido."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一项费用都和贷款报价单对一遍，涨了的就要问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare options: rent a moving truck, rent a portable container, or hire full-service movers." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compara opciones: alquilar un camión, alquilar un contenedor portátil o contratar una empresa completa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "比较方式：租搬家卡车、租便携储物箱，或雇全套搬家公司。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare plans on premium, deductible, copays, out-of-pocket max, your doctors, and your prescriptions." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compara los planes por prima, deducible, copagos, máximo de tu bolsillo, tus médicos y tus recetas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从保费、自付额、挂号自付、自付上限、你的医生和你的处方药来比较计划。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare the closing costs to your Loan Estimate." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compara los costos de cierre con tu Loan Estimate."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把过户费用与你的贷款估算单比较。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare the plans offered — premium, deductible, and whether your doctors are in-network." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compara los planes ofrecidos: prima, deducible y si tus médicos están en la red."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "比较所提供的计划：保费、自付额，以及你的医生是否在网络内。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Complete Form I-9 (work authorization) and Form W-4 (tax withholding) for %@." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Completa el Formulario I-9 (autorización de trabajo) y el Formulario W-4 (retención de impuestos) para %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为 %@ 填写 I-9 表（工作许可）和 W-4 表（税款预扣）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Complete whatever onboarding paperwork the organization asks for. There's no W-4 to file when there's no pay, and no paycheck to check." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Completa el papeleo de incorporación que pida la organización. Si no hay pago, no hay formulario W-4 que presentar ni nómina que revisar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按机构要求填写入职材料。没有报酬就不需要提交 W-4 表，也没有工资单需要核对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Complete your state tax form, if any." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Completa el formulario de impuestos de tu estado, si lo hay."
          }
