    "If anyone is hurt or in danger, call 911 now." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si alguien está herido o en peligro, llama al 911 ahora."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果有人受伤或处于危险中，请立即拨打 911。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If it was stolen, file a police report for your records." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si te la robaron, presenta una denuncia policial y guárdala."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果是被盗，请报警并保留报案记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If pain shows up hours or days later, see a doctor and save the records." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si el dolor aparece horas o días después, ve al médico y guarda los registros."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果疼痛在数小时或数天后出现，去看医生并保存记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If that address has an account, a code is on its way. It expires in 15 minutes." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si esa dirección tiene una cuenta, el código va en camino. Caduca en 15 minutos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果该邮箱已注册，验证码正在发送中。15 分钟内有效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the car isn't drivable, arrange a tow — and save the tow company, location, and receipt." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si el coche no se puede conducir, gestiona una grúa y guarda la empresa, el lugar y el recibo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果车无法驾驶，安排拖车，并保存拖车公司、地点和收据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the offer is accepted, save the signed purchase agreement." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si aceptan la oferta, guarda el contrato de compra firmado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "报价被接受后，保存签署的购房合同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the other driver is uninsured, ask your insurer what your policy covers in that situation." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si el otro conductor no tiene seguro, pregunta a tu aseguradora qué cubre tu póliza en ese caso."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果对方司机没有保险，请询问你的保险公司在这种情况下保单承保哪些内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the other driver is uninsured, your uninsured-motorist (UM) coverage can step in." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si el otro conductor no tiene seguro, tu cobertura de conductor sin seguro (UM) puede intervenir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果对方司机没有保险，你的“无保险驾驶人”（UM）保障可以顶上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If this is a medical emergency, call 911 or go to the ER. For urgent problems that can't wait, a walk-in urgent care may be faster than an appointment." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si es una emergencia médica, llama al 911 o ve a la sala de emergencias. Para problemas urgentes que no pueden esperar, una clínica de atención urgente sin cita puede ser más rápida que una cita."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果这是医疗急症，请拨打 911 或前往急诊室。对于不能等待的紧急问题，免预约的急诊诊所可能比预约更快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If unsure, call the number on your insurance card." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si tienes dudas, llama al número de tu tarjeta del seguro."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不确定时，拨打你保险卡上的电话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you get an RFE, NOID, or court notice, contact authorized legal help — don't rely on social media." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si recibes un RFE, NOID o aviso judicial, busca ayuda legal autorizada: no te fíes de las redes sociales."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果收到 RFE、NOID 或法院通知，请联系正规的法律帮助，不要依赖社交媒体。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you need an interpreter, ask for one when you book — it's free at most clinics." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si necesitas un intérprete, pídelo al reservar: en la mayoría de las clínicas es gratis."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果需要翻译，预约时就提出，大多数诊所免费提供。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you pick a Marketplace plan, pay the first premium — coverage doesn't start until you do." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si eliges un plan del Marketplace, paga la primera prima: la cobertura no empieza hasta que lo hagas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你选了市场计划，要缴第一期保费，不缴费保障不会开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you rent, first confirm which of these your landlord already includes." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si alquilas, primero confirma cuáles de estos ya incluye tu arrendador."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你是租房，请先确认房东已经包含了哪些服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you're getting a stipend, ask how it will be reported — a stipend can be taxable income even when the role is called unpaid." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si recibes un estipendio, pregunta cómo se declarará: un estipendio puede ser ingreso sujeto a impuestos aunque el puesto se llame no remunerado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果有津贴，问清楚将如何申报，即使职位被称为“无薪”，津贴也可能属于应税收入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
