    },
    "ITIN for U.S. taxes" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ITIN para impuestos de EE. UU."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用于美国报税的 ITIN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Job-based coverage usually has a short sign-up window — about 30 days from your start date. Miss it and you may wait until the company's yearly open enrollment." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La cobertura del trabajo suele tener un plazo corto de inscripción: unos 30 días desde tu fecha de inicio. Si lo pierdes, quizá debas esperar a la inscripción abierta anual de la empresa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "公司提供的保险通常有一个很短的参保窗口，从入职日起大约 30 天。错过就可能要等公司每年一次的公开参保期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Job-based coverage usually has a short sign-up window. Ask HR for your enrollment deadline as soon as you start — miss it and you may wait until the company's yearly open enrollment." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La cobertura del trabajo suele tener un plazo corto de inscripción. Pregunta a RR. HH. tu fecha límite en cuanto empieces: si la pierdes, quizá esperes a la inscripción anual."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "职场医保的登记窗口通常很短。入职后请立即向 HR 确认截止日期，错过可能要等公司年度开放登记。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Just me (sole proprietor)" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solo yo (empresario individual)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只有我（个体经营）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Just mine" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solo lo mío"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只看我的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Just starting" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apenas empezando"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "刚开始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep every bill, record, and receipt — the claim can reimburse them." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Guarda cada factura, registro y recibo: el reclamo puede reembolsarlos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留每张账单、病历和收据：理赔可以报销这些费用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep records: claim number, report number, estimates, medical bills." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Guarda los registros: número de reclamación, número de informe, presupuestos y facturas médicas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保存记录：理赔编号、报告编号、估价单、医疗账单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the inspection, financing, and appraisal contingencies — they let you back out safely if something goes wrong." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mantén las contingencias de inspección, financiamiento y avalúo: te permiten retirarte con seguridad si algo sale mal."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留验房、贷款和估价这几项附加条件（contingencies），出问题时它们让你安全退出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the receipt notice: it usually extends your permanent-resident status while the case is pending." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Guarda el aviso de recibo: suele extender tu estatus de residente permanente mientras el caso está pendiente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留收据通知：在案件审理期间，它通常可延长你的永久居民身份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep this to 200 characters or fewer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usa 200 caracteres o menos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请控制在 200 个字符以内。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep your lease, your deposit receipt and your move-in photos — they're how you show the unit's condition later. Deposit rules vary by state." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Guarda tu contrato, el recibo del depósito y las fotos de la mudanza: así demuestras el estado de la vivienda. Las normas sobre depósitos varían según el estado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
