          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "缴纳费用的款项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Payment is charged to your Apple Account at confirmation of purchase. Your subscription renews automatically unless you turn off auto-renew at least 24 hours before the end of the period. You can manage or cancel it in your App Store settings." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El pago se cargará a tu cuenta de Apple al confirmar la compra. Tu suscripción se renueva automáticamente a menos que desactives la renovación automática al menos 24 horas antes de que termine el periodo. Puedes gestionarla o cancelarla en los ajustes del App Store."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "确认购买后将从你的 Apple 账户扣款。除非在当前订阅期结束前至少 24 小时关闭自动续期，否则订阅将自动续期。你可以在 App Store 设置中管理或取消订阅。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
