    },
    "Renters insurance covers your belongings (theft, fire, water damage) and your liability — usually $10–20 a month. Your landlord's insurance does not cover your things." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El seguro de inquilinos cubre tus pertenencias (robo, incendio, daños por agua) y tu responsabilidad civil, por lo general $10–20 al mes. El seguro del arrendador no cubre tus cosas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "租客保险保障你的个人财物（失窃、火灾、水损）以及你的责任险，通常每月 10–20 美元。房东的保险并不保你的东西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
