    "Tadah Plus covers every profile on this account — no extra charge per person." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tadah Plus cubre todos los perfiles de esta cuenta, sin cargo adicional por persona."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tadah Plus 覆盖此账户下的所有成员，无需为每人额外付费。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tadah Plus includes %lld calls a month." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tadah Plus incluye %lld llamadas al mes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tadah Plus 每月包含 %lld 次通话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tadah Plus is coming soon" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tadah Plus llegará pronto"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tadah Plus 即将推出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tadah Plus is needed to have Tadah make a call." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Necesitas Tadah Plus para que Tadah haga una llamada."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要 Tadah Plus 才能让 Tadah 帮你打电话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tadah reminds you before it's due so you don't forget." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tadah te avisa antes del vencimiento para que no lo olvides."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tadah 会在到期前提醒你，免得忘记。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tadah says it's an AI, never gives out card, bank or Social Security numbers, and never agrees to a charge." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tadah dice que es una IA, nunca da números de tarjeta, banco o Seguro Social, y nunca acepta un cargo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tadah 会说明自己是 AI，绝不透露银行卡、银行账户或社会安全号码，也绝不答应任何费用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tadah turns a confusing bill or letter into simple steps like these." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tadah convierte una factura o carta confusa en pasos simples como estos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tadah 把看不懂的账单或信件变成像这样的简单步骤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TADAH WILL CALL" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TADAH LLAMARÁ A"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TADAH 将致电"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tadah will make the call in English and tell you what they said, in your language." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tadah hará la llamada en inglés y te dirá lo que dijeron, en tu idioma."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tadah 会用英语通话，然后用你的语言告诉你对方说了什么。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tadah will only ask. It won't agree to anything for you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tadah solo preguntará. No aceptará nada por ti."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tadah 只会询问，不会替你答应任何事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tadah works by reminding you before a bill, appointment, or form is due. Turn on notifications so those reminders can actually reach you — without them, Tadah can't nudge you in time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tadah te avisa antes de que venza una factura, cita o formulario. Activa las notificaciones para que esos recordatorios te lleguen; sin ellas, Tadah no puede avisarte a tiempo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tadah 会在账单、预约或表格到期前提醒你。请打开通知，这些提醒才能及时送达，否则 Tadah 无法及时提醒你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take a new photo if required and pay the renewal fee." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tómate una foto nueva si la piden y paga la tarifa de renovación."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如需重新拍照请配合拍摄，并缴纳换证费用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take the free online practice tests until you pass them comfortably." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Haz los exámenes de práctica gratuitos en línea hasta que los apruebes con holgura."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网上有免费的模拟题，一直做到轻松及格为止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take the Oath of Allegiance at your ceremony." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Presta el Juramento de Lealtad en tu ceremonia."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在仪式上宣读效忠誓词。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Add** below — that's where new to-dos start." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toca **Añadir** abajo: ahí empiezan los nuevos pendientes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点下方的**添加**，新的待办事项都从这里开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap ＋ Add to scan a document — Tadah explains it and what to do." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toca ＋ Añadir para escanear un documento: Tadah lo explica y te dice qué hacer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点按 ＋ 添加 来扫描文件 — Tadah 会解释它是什么以及该怎么做。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap ＋ below, then Scan — Tadah explains it and builds your steps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toca ＋ abajo y elige Escanear — Tadah lo explica y crea tus pasos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点下方的＋，选择扫描，Tadah 帮你看懂并生成步骤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a name to switch; new to-dos are filed under them. Swipe left to edit, right to remove — anyone but yourself." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toca un nombre para cambiar; las nuevas tareas se guardan bajo esa persona. Desliza a la izquierda para editar y a la derecha para quitar (a todos menos a ti)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点按名字即可切换，新的待办事项会归到 TA 名下。向左滑动可编辑，向右滑动可移除（自己除外）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap one to open it, or swipe it left to mark it done. You're all set." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toca uno para abrirlo o deslízalo a la izquierda para marcarlo hecho. ¡Todo listo!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点一下打开，向左滑标记完成。就这么简单！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the box to check off a step as you finish it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toca la casilla para marcar cada paso al terminarlo."
          }
