          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用条款"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TEST MODE — no call was actually placed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MODO DE PRUEBA: no se hizo ninguna llamada"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测试模式——并未真正拨打电话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test the heat, air conditioning, taps, and appliances that stay with the house." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prueba la calefacción, el aire acondicionado, las llaves de agua y los electrodomésticos que se quedan con la casa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "试一下暖气、空调、水龙头，以及随房子一起留下的电器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tests get canceled on the spot for the car, not the driving — a broken brake light or expired registration ends the appointment before you pull away." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los exámenes se cancelan en el acto por culpa del auto, no de cómo manejas: una luz de freno fundida o un registro vencido termina la cita antes de que arranques."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "路考被当场取消，多半是车的问题，不是开得不好。刹车灯坏了或者行驶证过期，车还没开动考试就结束了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That code didn't work. Check it and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ese código no funcionó. Revísalo e inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "验证码不正确。请检查后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That code didn't work. Codes expire after 30 minutes, and there are only five tries." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ese código no funcionó. Los códigos caducan a los 30 minutos y solo hay cinco intentos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "验证码不正确。验证码 30 分钟后失效，且最多只能尝试五次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That code isn't right, or it's expired. Ask for a new one." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ese código no es correcto o ha caducado. Pide uno nuevo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "验证码不正确或已过期。请重新获取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That email and password don't match an account." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ese correo y esa contraseña no coinciden con ninguna cuenta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该邮箱和密码与任何账户都不匹配。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That isn't a US phone number Tadah can dial." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ese no es un número de EE. UU. al que Tadah pueda llamar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这不是 Tadah 能拨打的美国电话号码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That password doesn't match, or your session has expired. Check the password, or sign out and back in." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esa contraseña no coincide, o tu sesión ha caducado. Revisa la contraseña, o cierra sesión y vuelve a iniciarla."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "密码不正确，或登录状态已过期。请检查密码，或退出后重新登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That person's list is already full. Remove a to-do from it first, then move this one." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La lista de esa persona ya está llena. Quita antes una tarea de esa lista y luego mueve esta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该成员的清单已满。请先从中删除一项待办事项，再移动这一项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's too long for one call. Shorten it by %lld characters." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es demasiado largo para una llamada. Acórtalo %lld caracteres."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "内容太长，一通电话放不下。请删减 %lld 个字符。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's too long for one call. Shorten what Tadah should ask, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es demasiado largo para una llamada. Acorta lo que Tadah debe preguntar y vuelve a intentarlo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "内容太长，一通电话放不下。请缩短要问的内容，然后再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %lld items saved on this device belong to a different account. Nothing has been uploaded. Move them to this account, or sign out and leave them exactly as they are." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los %lld elementos guardados en este dispositivo pertenecen a otra cuenta. No se ha subido nada. Muévelos a esta cuenta o cierra sesión y déjalos tal como están."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此设备上保存的 %lld 项内容属于另一个账户。尚未上传任何内容。你可以将它们移到此账户，或退出登录并原样保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI service is busy or this device hit its limit — please try again later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El servicio de IA está ocupado o este dispositivo alcanzó su límite — inténtalo más tarde."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 服务繁忙或本设备已达使用上限，请稍后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The answer stays on your to-do. A written copy of the call is deleted after 30 days, and no audio is ever recorded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La respuesta se queda en tu tarea. La copia escrita de la llamada se borra a los 30 días, y nunca se graba audio."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "结果会留在你的待办里。通话的文字记录 30 天后删除，且从不录音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection was interrupted. Tadah will check for the answer without placing another call." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The connection was interrupted. Tadah will check for the answer without placing another call."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La conexión se interrumpió. Tadah buscará la respuesta sin volver a llamar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接中断了。Tadah 会继续查询结果，不会再次拨打电话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The deposit amount — and exactly what you must do to get it back." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El monto del depósito, y exactamente qué debes hacer para recuperarlo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "押金金额，以及要拿回押金你到底得做些什么。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The inspection is for you, not the lender. It's the window where you can still ask for repairs, ask for a price cut, or walk away and keep your deposit — miss the deadline in your contract and those options close." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La inspección es para ti, no para el prestamista. Es la ventana en la que todavía puedes pedir reparaciones, pedir una rebaja o retirarte conservando tu depósito; si se te pasa la fecha del contrato, esas opciones se cierran."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "验房是为你自己做的，不是为贷款机构。在这段时间内你还可以要求维修、要求降价，或者退出交易并拿回定金。一旦超过合同里的期限，这些选择就都没有了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The insurance company bills you directly for this first payment — not HealthCare.gov — so watch for that first bill (mail, email, or their site) and pay by the due date, or your start date won't stick." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La compañía de seguros te cobra directamente este primer pago —no HealthCare.gov—, así que está atento a esa primera factura (correo, email o su sitio web) y paga antes de la fecha límite, o tu fecha de inicio no quedará firme."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这第一笔付款由保险公司直接向你收取，不是 HealthCare.gov，所以要留意第一张账单（邮寄、电子邮件或他们的网站），并在到期日前付清，否则你的保险生效日期就不作数了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The insurer usually inspects the damage — an adjuster visit or photos you upload — before approving repairs." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La aseguradora suele inspeccionar el daño —una visita del ajustador o fotos que subes— antes de aprobar las reparaciones."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保险公司通常会先查勘损失。理赔员上门或让你上传照片，然后才批准维修。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The lease is a binding contract — once you sign, its terms hold. Read every line and ask about anything unclear before you sign. If a promise isn't written in the lease, it doesn't count." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El contrato de arrendamiento es vinculante: una vez que firmas, sus términos rigen. Lee cada línea y pregunta por cualquier cosa que no entiendas antes de firmar. Si una promesa no está escrita en el contrato, no cuenta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "租约是有约束力的合同，一旦签字，条款就生效。签字前逐条阅读，任何不清楚的地方都要问。没有写进租约的承诺，都不算数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The lease is a binding contract — once you sign, its terms hold. Read every line, ask about anything unclear before signing, and get important promises in writing." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El contrato es vinculante: una vez firmado, rigen sus términos. Lee cada línea, pregunta lo que no entiendas antes de firmar y pon por escrito las promesas importantes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "租约具有法律约束力，签字后即以条款为准。逐条阅读，签前问清疑问，并将重要承诺写入书面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The money landed in the right bank account." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El dinero llegó a la cuenta bancaria correcta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "钱打进了正确的银行账户。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new place's ZIP code? (optional — sent to AI with your answers to find your local utility companies)" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿El código postal del nuevo lugar? (opcional: se envía a la IA con tus respuestas para encontrar las compañías de servicios de tu zona)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新住处的邮编？（可选：会连同你的回答发送给 AI，用于查找你所在地区的水电网公司）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The other driver hit me" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El otro conductor me chocó"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对方司机撞了我"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The police report number, if you have one." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El número del informe policial, si lo tienes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "警方报告编号（如果有）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The scanned photo is kept on the saved item so you can check the original anytime — it stays on your device. Turn off to stop saving photos for new scans." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La foto escaneada se guarda con el elemento para que puedas consultar el original cuando quieras — permanece en tu dispositivo. Desactívalo para no guardar fotos en los nuevos escaneos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "扫描的照片会保存在事项里，方便你随时查看原件，照片只保存在你的手机上。关闭后，新的扫描将不再保存照片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The text is whatever is printed on the page — that can include your name, a medical condition, a case or account number, or money details." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El texto es lo que esté impreso en la página: puede incluir tu nombre, una condición médica, un número de caso o de cuenta, o datos de dinero."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字就是页面上印的内容，可能包含你的姓名、健康状况、案件或账户号码，或者金额信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The walkthrough is usually the day before or the morning of closing. You're checking that agreed repairs were done and that nothing broke or disappeared since the inspection." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El recorrido final suele ser el día antes o la mañana del cierre. Estás comprobando que se hicieron las reparaciones acordadas y que nada se rompió ni desapareció desde la inspección."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最后一次验收一般在过户前一天或者当天早上。你要确认说好的维修都做了，而且验房之后没有东西坏掉或者被搬走。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The written test comes straight out of your state's driver handbook, which is free on the DMV site. Passing it plus a vision check gets you a learner's permit — the thing that lets you practice legally." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El examen escrito sale directamente del manual del conductor de tu estado, que es gratis en el sitio del DMV. Aprobarlo junto con la prueba de la vista te da el permiso de aprendizaje, que es lo que te deja practicar legalmente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "笔试题目就是从你所在州的驾驶手册里出的，手册在车管局网站上免费下载。笔试加视力测试通过后就能拿到实习驾照，有了它才可以合法上路练车。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their insurance company and policy number." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Su compañía de seguros y número de póliza."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对方的保险公司和保单号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their to-dos are deleted too. Yours aren't affected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sus tareas también se eliminan. Las tuyas no se ven afectadas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "他们的待办事项也会被删除。你的不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "them" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ellos"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对方"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's a problem with your payment. Update your payment method in the App Store to keep Tadah Plus." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hay un problema con tu pago. Actualiza tu método de pago en la App Store para conservar Tadah Plus."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的付款出现问题。请在 App Store 更新付款方式以继续使用 Tadah Plus。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's already an account with that email. Try signing in instead." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ya existe una cuenta con ese correo. Prueba a iniciar sesión."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该邮箱已注册。请改为登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This account is already signed in on the maximum number of devices." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta cuenta ya ha iniciado sesión en el número máximo de dispositivos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此账户已在最多允许的设备数量上登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device has %lld tasks that aren't in your account yet. Add them to your account, or use your account's tasks instead? (A backup is saved either way.)" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "This device has %lld task that isn't in your account yet. Add it to your account, or use your account's tasks instead? (A backup is saved either way.)"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "This device has %lld tasks that aren't in your account yet. Add them to your account, or use your account's tasks instead? (A backup is saved either way.)"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este dispositivo tiene %lld tareas que aún no están en tu cuenta. ¿Añadirlas a tu cuenta o usar las tareas de tu cuenta? (Se guarda una copia de seguridad en ambos casos.)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此设备上有 %lld 项待办事项尚未同步到你的账户。要把它们添加到账户，还是改用账户中的待办事项？（两种选择都会先保存备份。）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device's data belongs to another account" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los datos de este dispositivo pertenecen a otra cuenta"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此设备上的数据属于另一个账户"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a repeating task" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta es una tarea que se repite"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是一个重复任务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This isn't an invitation or a separate login." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto no es una invitación ni una cuenta aparte."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这不是邀请，也不是另一个登录账号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This list is full at %lld items. Delete one to add another." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta lista está llena con %lld elementos. Elimina uno para añadir otro."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此清单已满（%lld 项）。删除一项才能再添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This number came from your document." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este número viene de tu documento."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个号码来自你的文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes your account and everything backed up to it, on every device. Your saved items stay on this phone. This can't be undone." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto elimina permanentemente tu cuenta y todo lo respaldado en ella, en todos los dispositivos. Tus elementos guardados permanecen en este teléfono. No se puede deshacer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这将永久删除你的账户以及备份在其中的所有内容（所有设备）。此手机上已保存的事项会保留。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes your account and everything backed up to it, on every device. Your saved items stay on this phone. This can't be undone.\n\n⚠️ This does NOT cancel your Tadah Plus subscription — Apple handles billing, so you must cancel it in the App Store or you'll keep being charged." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto elimina permanentemente tu cuenta y todo lo respaldado en ella, en todos los dispositivos. Tus elementos guardados permanecen en este teléfono. No se puede deshacer.\n\n⚠️ Esto NO cancela tu suscripción a Tadah Plus: Apple gestiona los cobros, así que debes cancelarla en la App Store o te seguirán cobrando."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这将永久删除你的账户以及备份在其中的所有内容（所有设备）。此手机上已保存的事项会保留。此操作无法撤销。\n\n⚠️ 这不会取消你的 Tadah Plus 订阅。订阅由 Apple 计费，你必须在 App Store 中取消，否则将继续扣费。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes your account, everything backed up to it on every device, and disconnects your Apple ID from Tadah. You'll be asked to confirm with Apple. Your saved items stay on this phone. This can't be undone." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto elimina permanentemente tu cuenta, todo lo respaldado en ella desde cualquier dispositivo, y desconecta tu Apple ID de Tadah. Se te pedirá confirmarlo con Apple. Lo que tienes guardado en este teléfono se conserva. Esta acción no se puede deshacer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这将永久删除你的账户、所有设备上备份到该账户的全部内容，并断开你的 Apple ID 与 Tadah 的关联。系统会要求你通过 Apple 确认。你保存在这台手机上的内容会保留。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes your account from this device. Your saved items stay on the device." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto elimina tu cuenta de este dispositivo. Tus elementos guardados permanecen en el dispositivo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这会从这台设备上移除你的账户。你保存的事项仍会保留在设备上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This same permission covers one more thing: in the moving and renting guides, a ZIP code you type is sent with your answers to name your local utility companies. Every other guide is built on your phone." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este mismo permiso cubre una cosa más: en las guías de mudanza y alquiler, el código postal que escribas se envía junto con tus respuestas para nombrar las compañías de servicios de tu zona. Todas las demás guías se crean en tu teléfono."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同一项许可还包含一件事：在搬家和租房指南中，你输入的邮编会连同你的回答一起发送，用于列出你所在地区的水电网公司。其他所有指南都在你的手机上生成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This scan has several items. Pick which to add — you can edit each one afterward." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este escaneo tiene varios elementos. Elige cuáles añadir — puedes editar cada uno después."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这次扫描包含多个项目。选择要添加的项 — 之后可逐个编辑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This sets the language Tadah uses to explain your documents (it defaults to your phone's language). The app itself follows your phone's language. A few sensitive guides — money, immigration, medical — stay in English on your device." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto define el idioma con que Tadah explica tus documentos (por defecto, el de tu teléfono). La app en sí sigue el idioma de tu teléfono. Algunas guías sensibles —dinero, inmigración, médico— se quedan en inglés y en tu dispositivo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这里设置 Tadah 解释你文件时使用的语言（默认与手机语言一致）。应用本身会跟随手机语言。少数敏感指南（财务、移民、医疗）会保留英文并仅存于你的设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This still needs you — Tadah couldn't finish it on the call." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto todavía te necesita: Tadah no pudo terminarlo en la llamada."
