          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你可以关闭此页面——结果会保存到这条待办里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can start earning as a sole proprietor right away, then form an LLC later as you grow." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puedes empezar a ganar como empresario individual de inmediato y formar una LLC más adelante al crecer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你可以先以个体经营者身份立即开始赚钱，之后随着发展再成立 LLC。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can try again now or later — nothing is lost either way." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puedes reintentarlo ahora o más tarde: no se pierde nada en ningún caso."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你可以现在重试，也可以稍后再试，无论哪种方式都不会丢失任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You changed this number." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cambiaste este número."
