    "you@example.com" : {

    },
    "Your account was not deleted. Please check your connection and try again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu cuenta no se eliminó. Comprueba tu conexión e inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的账户未被删除。请检查网络连接后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your account wasn't fully deleted. Tap Delete account again to finish — we'll pick up where we left off." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu cuenta no se eliminó por completo. Toca Eliminar cuenta otra vez para terminar: continuaremos donde lo dejamos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的账户尚未完全删除。再次点按“删除账户”即可继续，我们会从中断处接着完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your agent drafts the offer using recent sales of similar homes. The earnest-money deposit (often 1–3%) shows you're serious and counts toward your purchase at closing." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu agente redacta la oferta usando ventas recientes de casas similares. El depósito de buena fe (a menudo 1–3%) muestra que vas en serio y se acredita a tu compra en el cierre."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "经纪人会参考近期同类房屋的成交价来起草报价。诚意金（通常 1–3%）表明你是认真的，并会在过户时计入房款。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your copay or a payment method." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu copago o un método de pago."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的自付额或一种付款方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your employer gives you an enrollment deadline when you start, and the window can be short. Check it in your first week — miss it and you may wait until the next enrollment period." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu empleador te dará una fecha límite de inscripción al empezar, y el plazo puede ser corto. Revísalo en tu primera semana: si lo pierdes, podrías esperar al siguiente período."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "入职时雇主会给出福利登记截止日期，时间可能很短。第一周就确认，错过可能要等下一个登记期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your family members and all your devices are covered." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tus familiares y todos tus dispositivos están cubiertos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的家庭成员和所有设备都已涵盖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your household size and income decide everything — whether you qualify for Medicaid and how large your Marketplace savings are. Lawfully present immigrants can use the Marketplace and often qualify for these savings; undocumented adults generally can't, though some states cover children and pregnancy regardless of status." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El tamaño de tu hogar y tus ingresos lo deciden todo: si calificas para Medicaid y qué tan grandes son tus ahorros del Marketplace. Los inmigrantes con presencia legal pueden usar el Marketplace y a menudo califican para estos ahorros; los adultos indocumentados por lo general no, aunque algunos estados cubren a niños y el embarazo sin importar el estatus."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "家庭人数和收入决定一切：你是否符合 Medicaid 资格，以及你能获得多少市场补贴。有合法身份的移民可以使用市场并且通常符合补贴资格；无证成年人一般不行，但部分州无论身份都为儿童和孕期提供保障。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your information stays on this phone." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu información se queda en este teléfono."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的信息仅保存在这部手机上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your items are saved — signing back in brings them right back." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
