    "Your lender orders the appraisal. If it comes in under the price, you renegotiate, pay the difference, or use your appraisal contingency." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu prestamista ordena el avalúo. Si resulta menor que el precio, renegocias, pagas la diferencia o usas tu contingencia de avalúo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "贷款机构会安排估价。如果估价低于成交价，你可以重新谈价、自己补差价，或者依据估价条款退出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your list is full at %lld items, so only %lld of %lld were added. Delete some to add the rest." : {
